texto:
if you are having a bad day don't let others give you a bad day, let apex do it for you,

great game 10/10
apex packs are way too adictive

não recomendo por alguns motivos simples:
- quem é novato vai se fuder horrores pq fairplay de BR é dive;
- pros que voltam a jogar dps de mtos anos, é horrivel pq só tem crackudo jogando isso e eles vão te amassar;
- esse game já foi bom há milianos atrás, hoje me dia não vale a pena voltar;

Keeping in mind that this game was released years ago;
PVE 6/10. You can have fun in regular instances and dungeons. You'll miss out on a lot of the 'good' gear If you're a solo player with 0 intentions in joining a well-established clan.

PVP 2/10. IDK where to begin with this. My main issue is map design and the aim assist controller players get. Get ready to get 3 tapped in every engagement against a controller player using a hand cannon. the aim assist is busted. Don't believe me, go watch some random youtuber miss his shots on-screen but land precision hits because aim assist held their hand. If you get the best of them, guess what? They can hide behind a wall, pull-out a pocket shotgun, and erase you.

3.7 - Improved performance on my machine by 50-100 % (great);
3.8 - Introduced launcher to steam version (r u joking?);
1 step forward 2 steps back!
Please, KURO, revert back to not using launcher bloatware (spyware? cough NIKKE cough);
Worst "QOL" update ever;

THE FACTORY MUST GROW

// on Linux / SteamOS
use DW_Proton and the launch options: PROTON_ENABLE_WAYLAND=1 %command% -vulkan

Top 5 games I play. There not really anything wrong with the game. BUT MY FUCKING RIVEN LUCK???????? Other than that great game! 9/10 ;-;
